<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2097485069"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1768009413"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="迷星叫"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MyGO!!!!!"/><amll:meta key="album" value="迷跡波"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:31.435"><div begin="00:16.605" end="03:08.148"><p begin="00:16.605" end="00:21.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">交差点の真ん中 急ぐ人に紛れて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">置身十字路口正中央 混入熙来攘往的人群</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko u sa te n no ma n na ka i so gu hi to ni ma gi re te</span></p><p begin="00:21.542" end="00:25.993" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">僕だけがあてもなく 漂うみたいだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯独我漫无目的 有如流浪者一般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku da ke ga a te mo na ku ta da yo u mi ta i da</span></p><p begin="00:26.656" end="00:28.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">流行りの歌はいつも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那些流行的首首歌曲</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ya ri no u ta wa i tsu mo</span></p><p begin="00:29.014" end="00:31.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">僕のことは歌ってない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">总是唱不出我的心思</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ko to wa u ta 't te na i</span></p><p begin="00:31.463" end="00:33.471" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">ねえビジョンの中から<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请别在幻象之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e bi jo n no na ka ka ra</span></p><p begin="00:33.488" end="00:35.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">笑いかけないで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对着我露出微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ra i ka ke na i de</span></p><p begin="00:36.543" end="00:39.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">また今日も声にならずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">今天又语不成声</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ta kyo u mo ko e ni na ra zu ni</span></p><p begin="00:39.010" end="00:41.270" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">飲み込んだ感情<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将感情吞入心底</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">no mi ko n da ka n jo u</span></p><p begin="00:41.470" end="00:44.105" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">下書き埋め尽くして<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">书页写满了草稿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi ta ga ki u me tsu ku shi te</span></p><p begin="00:44.105" end="00:49.116" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">ああ そうやって何千回夜を越える<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 就这么度过了数千个夜晚</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a so u ya 't te na n ze n ka i yo ru wo ko e ru</span></p><p begin="00:49.416" end="00:52.415" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">僕のため それだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ta me</span></p><p begin="00:52.615" end="00:54.866" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">それだけだったんだよ<span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re da ke so re da ke da 't ta n da yo</span></p><p begin="00:55.166" end="01:00.438" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">出口探し 溢(こぼ)れただけの言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为从心头满溢而出的话语找寻出口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">de gu chi sa ga shi ko bo re ta da ke no ko to ba</span></p><p begin="01:00.638" end="01:02.873" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">君の心へ届いて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若能传达至你的心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no ko ko ro he to do i te</span></p><p begin="01:02.873" end="01:05.676" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">隙間をちょっと埋めるなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">稍稍填补虚无的空隙</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki ma wo cho 't to u me ru na ra</span></p><p begin="01:05.876" end="01:10.180" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">こんな僕でも ここにいる 叫ぶよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">即使是这样的我 也将大喊我在这里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na bo ku de mo ko ko ni i ru sa ke bu yo</span></p><p begin="01:10.870" end="01:15.585" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">迷い星のうた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱着迷途之星的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i bo shi no u ta</span></p><p begin="01:23.394" end="01:25.733" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">問われることは何故か<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不知为何每每问起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">to wa re ru ko to wa na ze ka</span></p><p begin="01:25.833" end="01:28.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">将来のことばかり<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">谈论的总都是未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sho u ra i no ko to ba ka ri</span></p><p begin="01:28.461" end="01:32.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">目の前にいる僕の 今はおざなりで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但讲到眼前的我 却总是敷衍了事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me no ma e ni i ru bo ku no i ma wa o za na ri de</span></p><p begin="01:33.514" end="01:35.823" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">華やぎに馴染めない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无视于我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha na ya gi ni na ji me na i</span></p><p begin="01:35.923" end="01:38.267" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">この心を無視して<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法融入亮丽世界的心绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ko ko ro wo mu shi shi te</span></p><p begin="01:38.567" end="01:43.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">輝かしい明日を 推奨しないでくれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请不要推荐我走向散发光辉的明天</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ka ga ya ka shi i a shi ta wo su i sho u shi na i de ku re</span></p><p begin="01:43.445" end="01:48.301" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">夜空にチカチカ光る 頼りない星屑<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空中闪烁光芒 无依无靠的星尘</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra ni chi ka chi ka hi ka ru ta yo ri na i ho shi ku zu</span></p><p begin="01:48.501" end="01:51.005" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">躊躇(ためら)いながらはぐれて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在踌躇之中失散</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta me ra i na ga ra ha gu re te</span></p><p begin="01:51.005" end="01:56.249" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">ああ 彷徨っているそれが僕<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 那颗彷徨的星就是我啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a a sa ma yo 't te i ru so re ga bo ku</span></p><p begin="01:56.449" end="01:59.338" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">僕になる それしか<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">成为我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ni na ru</span></p><p begin="01:59.338" end="02:01.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">それしかできないだろう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只有如此 我能做的只有如此</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re shi ka so re shi ka de ki na i da ro u</span></p><p begin="02:01.969" end="02:07.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">誰の真似も 上手くやれないんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">模仿他人那种事 我也没办法做得好</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re no ma ne mo u ma ku ya re na i n da</span></p><p begin="02:07.602" end="02:09.857" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">こんな痛い日々をなんで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何要将这种痛苦的日子</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko n na i ta i hi bi wo na n de</span></p><p begin="02:09.857" end="02:12.593" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">退屈だって片付ける?<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用一句无趣带过？</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta i ku tsu da 't te ka ta zu ke ru ?</span></p><p begin="02:12.793" end="02:15.342" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">よろめきながらでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就算步伐多踉跄</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo ro me ki na ga ra de mo</span></p><p begin="02:15.342" end="02:16.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">もがいているんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也是在挣扎着啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mo ga i te i ru n da yo</span></p><p begin="02:17.855" end="02:22.288" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">迷い星のうた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱着迷途之星的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i bo shi no u ta</span></p><p begin="02:41.702" end="02:44.809" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">僕のため それだけ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了我自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku no ta me</span></p><p begin="02:44.909" end="02:47.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">それだけだったんだよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只是如此 就仅仅是如此而已</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re da ke so re da ke da 't ta n da yo</span></p><p begin="02:47.526" end="02:52.937" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">涙流し やっと生まれた言葉<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在流下泪水之后 才终于诞生的话语</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da na ga shi ya 't to u ma re ta ko to ba</span></p><p begin="02:53.237" end="02:55.336" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">どこかで同じように<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">彼此似乎有些许相似</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka de o na ji yo u ni</span></p><p begin="02:55.336" end="02:58.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">ヒリヒリする胸抱えて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀抱隐隐作痛的胸口</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ri hi ri su ru mu ne ka ka e te</span></p><p begin="02:58.225" end="03:02.976" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">震える君に 僕もいる 叫ぶよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">面对在颤抖的你 大喊着我与你同在</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu ru e ru ki mi ni bo ku mo i ru sa ke bu yo</span></p><p begin="03:03.376" end="03:08.148" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">迷い星のうた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唱着迷途之星的歌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma yo i ho shi no u ta</span></p></div></body></tt>